From 2d25acb3e01a6db3f184eab4f20996dc5cba639c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:19:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Rate limit client registration, revoke on refresh replay,
 authenticate revoke

Registration is limited to 10 per IP and 300 total per hour. Presenting an already rotated refresh token revokes everything that app holds for that person. /oauth/revoke now authenticates the client and only revokes that client's tokens. The discovery document is not cacheable.
